  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15.1">
        <head>Cn 1018 15.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="15.1" corresp="#wit-d">And beo þam halgan [tidan] ealswa hit riht is. eallum cristenum mannum sibb 7 som gemæne. 7 ælc sacu totwǽmed.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And beo þam halgan tidan, ealswa hit riht is, eallum Cristenum mannum sibb and som gemæne, and ælc sacu totwǽmed.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And let there be peace and concord among all Christian men at the holy times, just as is proper, and every dispute set aside.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And at holy times, just as is proper, there is to be peace and friendship among all Christians, and each dispute is to be resolved.</ab>
        <note type="comparedBy" source="#wormald-mel" n="357"><ref target="clause:ICn_17-2">I Cn 17.2–3</ref></note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">tidan: omitted D</note>
      </div>
    </body>
